α-Damascone
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Bovolenta, Marcella; Castronovo, Francesca; Vadala, Alessandro; Zanoni,
Giuseppe; Vidari, Giovanni
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2004), 69(25), 8959-8962

