$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of 1-(2-bromophenyl)but-3-en-1-ol (3): Allylmagnesium chloride
(2.0 M in THF, 52.20 mL, 104.47 mmol) was added slowly to a stirred
solution of 2-bromobenzaldehyde (16.11 g, 87.05 mmol) in 250 mL THF at
room temperature. The obtained solution was stirred for 15 h, and was
quenched with saturated aqueous NH4Cl (50 mL). The organic layer was
collected and the aqueous layer was extracted with Et2O (2 x 50 mL). The
combined organic layers were washed with brine, dried with MgSO4, and
concentrated in vacuo. The crude product was purified by flash
chromatography on silica gel (10% EtOAc/Hexanes). The desired alcohol 3
as a pale yellow oil (18.73 g, 82.88 mmol, 95%). IR (neat, cm-1) 3389
(s), 3073 (m), 2979 (m), 2912 (m), 1639 (m), 1568 (m), 1468 (s), 1439
(s), 1195 (m), 1126 (m), 1023 (s), 917 (s), 754 (s); 1H NMR (500 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 7.59-7.55 (m, 1 H), 7.52 (d, J = 7.9 Hz, 1 H), 7.34 (t, J = 7.5
Hz, 1 H), 7.16-7.11 (m, 1 H), 5.93-5.83 (m, 1 H), 5.24-5.16 (m, 2 H),
5.14-5.09 (m, 1 H), 2.69-2.62 (m, 1 H), 2.40-2.32 (m, 1 H), 2.14 (d, J =
3.4 Hz, 1 H); 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 142.8, 134.4, 132.8, 129.0,
127.8, 127.5, 121.9, 118.9, 72.0, 42.3; HRMS (CI+) m/z (M-C3H5)+: Calcd
for C7H6OBr: 184.9602, found: 184.9608.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM slow addition of Grignard reagent stage 1, Grignard reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Recyclable Polystyrene-Supported Siloxane-Transfer Agent for
Palladium-Catalyzed Cross-Coupling Reactions
