$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A 0.7 g (4.6 mmol) sample of the above aldehyde was treated with 9.2 mL
(4.6 mmol) of a 0.5 M solution of ethynylmagnesium bromide in THF to
afford 0.8 g (97%) of 1-[2-(2-methylallyl)phenyl]prop-2-yn-1-ol (20b) as
a pale yellow oil: 1-[2-(2-methylallyl)phenyl]prop-2-yn-1-ol (20b), yield
0.8 g (97%). IR (neat) 3387, 1645, 1449 cm-1; 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ
1.75 (s, 3H), 2.27 (brs, 1H), 2.62 (d, 1H, J = 2.4 Hz), 3.43 (d, 1H, J =
16.1 Hz), 3.54 (d, 1H, J = 16.1 Hz), 4.53 (s, 1H), 4.84 (s, 1H), 5.64 (s,
1H), 7.15-7.19 (m, 1H), 7.24-7.31 (m, 2H), 7.69-7.75 (m, 1H); 13C NMR (75
MHz, CDCl3) δ 22.8, 40.8, 61.8, 74.6, 83.5, 112.2, 127.0, 127.1, 128.7,
130.8, 137.0, 138.4, 145.3.
