$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Catalytic Enantioselective Allylation of
Arylaldehyde with Allyl(trichloro)silane.
(S)-1-(4-Trifluoromethylphenyl)-3-buten-1-ol4 ((S)-8e).. 1H NMR (CDCl3) δ
2.22 (b, 1H), 2.50 (m, 2H), 4.80 (dd, J = 7.8, 4.8 Hz, 1H), 5.18 (m, 2H),
5.79 (dddd, J = 17.7, 9.7, 7.9, 6.5 Hz, 1H), 7.48 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 2H),
7.61 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 2H); 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ 43.9, 72.5, 119.2, 124.2 (q,
J = 271.0 Hz), 125.3 (q, J = 3.7 Hz), 126.1, 129.6 (q, J = 32.3 Hz),
133.7, 147.8. [α]20D -18.1 (c 1.9, C6H6). 56% ee by HPLC analysis: tR
(S)-(-), 48.0 min; (R)-(+), 51.9 min, (Chiralcel OJ, hexane/2-propanol =
100/1, 0.40 mL/min). lit.4 for (S)-8e of 80% ee: [α]24D -25.5 (c 1.50,
C6H6).
