$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Representative Procedure IV. Preparation of
(S)-1-(2'-Naphthyl)-3-buten-1-ol (3ab) Preparation of
(S)-1-(4'-Trifluoromethylphenyl)-3-buten-1-ol (3ad) Following
Representative Procedure IV, from 50 mg of 25d (0.1 mmol, 0.05 equiv) in
1.0 mL of dichloromethane and 1.0 mL of diisopropylethylamine, 580 μL of
allylic trichlorosilane (4.0 mmol, 2.0 equiv), 273 μL of
4-trifluoromethylbenzaldehyde (2.0 mmol) was obtained 341 mg of 3ad 15
(79%) after column chromatography ((SiO2) CH2Cl2/pentane, 3/1 followed by
CH2Cl2) as a colorless oil. Data for (-)-3ad: 1H NMR: (500 MHz, CDCl3)
7.60 (d, J = 8.2, 2 H, 2 x HC(3')), 7.47 (d, J = 8.0, 2 H, 2 x HC(2')),
5.79 (m, 1 H, HC(3)), 5.18 (m, 2 H, H2C(4)), 4.79 (m, 1 H, HC(1)),
2.57-2.42 (m, 2 H, HC(2)), 2.20 (d, J = 3.2, OH) 13C NMR: (126 MHz,
CDCl3) 147.7 (C(1')), 133.7 (C(3)), 129.7 (q, J = 32.3, C(4')), 126.1
(C(2')), 125.3 (q, J = 3.7, C(3')), 124.1 (q, J = 261.6, CF3), 119.2
(C(4)), 72.5 (C(1)), 43.9 (C(2)) IR: (NaCl) 3413 (s), 3079 (m), 2983 (w),
2935 (m), 2910 (m), 1924 (w), 1679 (w), 1643 (m), 1621 (m), 1417 (s),
1326 (s), 1164 (s), 1126 (s), 1068 (s), 991 (s), 921 (s), 842 (s), 763
(m) Opt. Rot.: [α]D 24 −25.5 (c = 1.50, benzene) (Lit.15 [α]D 24 +24.6
(benzene) for 71% ee (R)-3ad) TLC: R f 0.42 (CH2Cl2) [KMnO4] GC: (R)-3ad,
t R 8.9 min (9.9%); (S)-3ad, t R, 9.6 min (90.1%) (Chiraldex GTA, 100 °C,
16 psi)
