$DATUM S-Ethyl
(2R,3R,4E,6S,7R)-2,4,6-trimethyl-7-(triethylsilyl)oxy-3-(trimethylsilyl)oxy-4-octenethioate
(17). A mixture of Sn(OTf)2 (399 mg, 0.861 mmol) and 16 (224 mg, 0.932
mmol) in EtCN (10 mL) was stirred at room temperature for 15 min before
being cooled to -78°C. To the mixture was added dropwise a solution of 8
(1.04 g, 4.05 mmol) and 15 (1.17 g, 6.13 mmol) in EtCN (10 mL) over 3 h.
After being stirred at -78°C for an additional 2 h, the mixture was
quenched with Et3N (1 mL) and saturated aq NaHCO3. The mixture was
gradually warmed to room temperature and filtered. The filtrate was
extracted with Et2O and the extract was washed with brine, dried (MgSO4),
and concentrated in vacuo. The residue was purified by silica gel column
chromatography (hexane/EtOAc = 50:1-5:1). 1.56 g (86%) of 17 and 152 mg
(10%) of the corresponding TMS-deprotected alcohol (3-OH-17) as colorless
oils. 17: [α]23 D -21.9 (c 1.04, CHCl3); IR: ν max 1688 (s), 1456 (m),
1250 (s), 1070 (s), 961 (s); 1H NMR (400 MHz): δ 0.07 (9H, s), 0.58 (6H,
q, J = 8.0 Hz), 0.91-0.99 (15H, m), 1.18 (3H, d, J = 6.8 Hz), 1.21 (3H,
t, J = 7.5 Hz), 1.61 (3H, s), 2.37-2.46 (1H, m), 2.68-2.90 (3H, m), 3.69
(1H, dq, J = 3.1, 6.3 Hz), 4.13 (1H, d, J = 8.2 Hz), 5.21 (1H, d, J = 9.6
Hz); 13C NMR (100 MHz): δ 0.0 (3C), 4.9 (3C), 6.9 (3C), 11.3, 14.0, 14.4,
14.7, 19.7, 23.0, 39.1, 53.1, 70.8, 80.2, 130.7, 134.6, 201.6; HRMS (EI):
m/z calcd for C22H46O3SSi2, 446.2706; found, 446.2704 (M+). 3-OH-17:
[α]22 D -21.1 (c 1.10, CHCl3); IR: ν max 3455 (br m), 1685 (s), 1376 (m),
1642 (m), 1005 (s), 958 (s); 1H NMR (400 MHz): δ 0.58 (6H, q, J = 8.0
Hz), 0.94 (3H, d, J = 5.6 Hz), 0.95 (9H, t, J = 8.0 Hz), 1.01 (3H, d, J =
6.3 Hz), 1.19 (3H, d, J = 7.1 Hz), 1.24 (3H, t, J = 7.5 Hz), 1.63 (3H,
s), 2.15 (1H, d, J = 2.9 Hz, OH), 2.39-2.49 (1H, m), 2.77-2.94 (3H, m),
3.66-3.74 (1H, m), 4.26-4.31 (1H, br m), 5.37 (1H, d, J = 9.8 Hz); 13C
NMR (100 MHz): δ 4.9 (3C), 6.9 (3C), 12.1, 12.8, 14.5, 15.4, 20.1, 23.2,
39.4, 51.4, 71.1, 77.1, 130.4, 133.4, 203.1; HRMS (FAB): m/z calcd for
C19H38O3SSiNa, 397.2209; found, 397.2206 ([M+Na]+).
